B%E7%BB%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/4/4b/3o4039wj2u6ksjvqa3h76ix4nckng07.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E7%9B%9B%E7%BB%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/4/4b/3o4039wj2u6ksjvqa3h76ix4nckng07.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />盛绽\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>范围攻击、对单位\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>1-4\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓8-↑8\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（魔法伤害）对目标范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内所有敌人造成<font color=\"#d68fe2\">120%</font>伤害，若敌人处于[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"花田\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">花田</font></span></span>]，则额外对其造成伤害提高<font color=\"#d68fe2\">20%</font>。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-4 3.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/df/6yv5uheq339bec6azjhmfdefj74z2gi.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-4_3.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/d/df/6yv5uheq339bec6azjhmfdefj74z2gi.png 1.5x\" data-file